# ── Dependencies ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/

# ── Secrets & keys — this repo is public by design; nothing secret enters it ─
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
auth.json
.hermes/auth.json
.hermes/trust.json

# ── Per-owner personal data (PII) — LOCAL ONLY, never committed or pushed ────
# Owner profile written during forge, the personalized project prompt built from it
# (AGENTS.override.md — what Hermes actually loads), and any *.local.* the buyer creates.
.hermes/owner.local.md
AGENTS.override.md
**/owner.local.md
*.local
*.local.*

# ── Hermes runtime state ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.hermes/sessions/
.hermes/npm/
.hermes/git/
*.log

# ── OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
